    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="8" relname="joint">(56) The challenge facing World Wildlife Fund is global.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="8" relname="joint">(57) And time is running out.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="7" relname="span">(58) We need your membership support now.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="9" relname="span">(59) Extinction can come quickly.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="4" relname="interpretation">(60) And extinction is forever.</segment>
